export const cues = [{"s":5.44,"e":11.4,"text":"Hi team. Welcome to step 2 of our initial setup. I'd like for you to watch this with your operator,"},{"s":11.4,"e":15.84,"text":"which is the teammate who sets all of this up and runs it alongside you. The goal for"},{"s":15.84,"e":20.2,"text":"us in this session is that we get every team at the same starting line before we"},{"s":20.2,"e":25.32,"text":"actually start building. Which means your AI is set up and connected to all of your"},{"s":25.32,"e":30.04,"text":"other tech tools, that anything that could send or change things without your approval"},{"s":30.04,"e":36.04,"text":"gets blocked from the start, that we do one practice hire, test the hire and ensure"},{"s":36.04,"e":42.16,"text":"that it can run on its own, and then lastly that all six tasks get timed out so we know"},{"s":42.16,"e":46.56,"text":"your benchmark for how much time you're spending on these tasks we're about to replace."},{"s":46.56,"e":50.76,"text":"To make sure that we are ready for our December 2nd start date, I would love for"},{"s":50.76,"e":56.92,"text":"this initial setup to all be completed by Monday, November 30th. There are 8 steps"},{"s":56.92,"e":62.76,"text":"in this foundations course, and you are now on number 2. A few of these steps belong"},{"s":62.76,"e":68,"text":"to the owner, the primary person who purchased this course, like filling in the intake"},{"s":68,"e":74.46,"text":"form and timing out the six tasks, and then your operator, your supporter, is going"},{"s":74.46,"e":79.6,"text":"to take the setup steps, which means getting your AI ready, connecting your data, and"},{"s":79.64,"e":85.28,"text":"then putting the safety settings in place. And then the AI brain step, where we teach"},{"s":85.28,"e":91.12,"text":"your AI about who you are, what your business is, is one that each of you will do."},{"s":91.12,"e":97.28,"text":"So let's start with how a week in this course is going to run. Every week we follow"},{"s":97.28,"e":102.92,"text":"the same exact loop so that you always know what's coming. Before the live builds,"},{"s":102.92,"e":109.12,"text":"by Tuesday night, your operator will run that week's skill. A skill is just a playbook"},{"s":109.16,"e":115.96,"text":"that we're going to load into your AI tool, and the owner reads what it finds or produces."},{"s":115.96,"e":120.68,"text":"On Wednesday we're going to do the live build together. After the build, the first"},{"s":120.68,"e":127.02,"text":"run of your new AI hire is going to land in your platform, and I'll explain what"},{"s":127.02,"e":132.6,"text":"a hire is in just a minute. And then on Thursday we're going to hold office hours."},{"s":132.6,"e":138.44,"text":"And then we wrap up the week with the checkpoint before the next build begins."},{"s":138.44,"e":143.52,"text":"The live build on Wednesday is going to be 90 minutes, and here is how I plan on using"},{"s":143.52,"e":148.24,"text":"that time with y'all. For the first 10 minutes, we look at the question for the"},{"s":148.24,"e":152.04,"text":"week that we're trying to answer, which is, what is the number that we're focused"},{"s":152.04,"e":157.84,"text":"on and why does it matter this month? Then I will read three or four of your reports"},{"s":157.84,"e":163.4,"text":"live so that we can digest what it's telling you. And then we're going to move into the"},{"s":163.4,"e":169,"text":"hire lab, where we build the actual hire together. And then we close every"},{"s":169,"e":173.76,"text":"week with the commit, which is the task that the hire actually takes over and"},{"s":173.76,"e":180.36,"text":"who it essentially reports to. After the build, your hire's first run is going to"},{"s":180.36,"e":186.08,"text":"land, and then the owner is going to sign off on what it produces. On Thursday,"},{"s":186.08,"e":189.64,"text":"like I said, we hold office hours, which is where I'm going to support you"},{"s":189.64,"e":194,"text":"guys in getting your setup unstuck if anything isn't working correctly for you."},{"s":194,"e":198,"text":"And then the checkpoint is how we confirm that the week is actually done"},{"s":198,"e":201.08,"text":"and that we've found success in what we wanted to accomplish for those"},{"s":201.08,"e":206.68,"text":"seven days. That means the signed seat card, a screenshot of that first run, and"},{"s":206.68,"e":209.76,"text":"then the minutes that the hire took over and the time that it's saving"},{"s":209.76,"e":215.08,"text":"you. I hope all of that is making sense. Now I want to share with you a"},{"s":215.08,"e":221.44,"text":"little bit about what we mean by a hire. When we say an AI hire or an AI employee,"},{"s":221.44,"e":226.24,"text":"we use those interchangeably, we mean a skill that runs on a schedule and"},{"s":226.24,"e":230.72,"text":"leaves a draft on one person's desk. The skill is the playbook that it"},{"s":230.72,"e":235.36,"text":"actually follows. It's SOP. The schedule is when it runs, and we're"},{"s":235.36,"e":240.52,"text":"going to set all of our run times in your local time. The draft is what it"},{"s":240.52,"e":244.8,"text":"produces, what it writes for you, and it's always something for you to check"},{"s":244.84,"e":250.4,"text":"before anything gets sent or anything goes to another person. And the desk is"},{"s":250.4,"e":255.6,"text":"the one person who that employee actually reports into. So just like"},{"s":255.6,"e":260.88,"text":"anyone that we would bring into a team, every hire gets a job description and"},{"s":260.88,"e":265.64,"text":"we call that a seat card in our terminology. It lists the hire's name,"},{"s":265.64,"e":271.56,"text":"who it reports to, when it runs, what it reads, the playbook and SOP that it"},{"s":271.56,"e":276.08,"text":"uses, what it actually produces for you, the task that it took over, what it"},{"s":276.08,"e":281.52,"text":"can't or shouldn't do, and its first run. So here is a real example from"},{"s":281.52,"e":285.28,"text":"week two, so you can see what this is going to look like. This is called"},{"s":285.28,"e":290.72,"text":"the lead desk monitor, and it reports to your team leader, whoever is"},{"s":290.72,"e":294.88,"text":"responsible for production, and it runs every weekday morning at 7am local"},{"s":294.88,"e":300.92,"text":"time. It leaves a list of missed leads as a Gmail draft, and it never"},{"s":300.92,"e":305.92,"text":"includes a client name or anything, and it can't call, text, reassign or"},{"s":305.92,"e":312.08,"text":"update a lead. Now let's talk about why we time the six tasks that we're"},{"s":312.08,"e":317.48,"text":"about to create in this course before we actually begin building their"},{"s":317.48,"e":322.2,"text":"replacement. Each hire that we build should be taking over one of those"},{"s":322.2,"e":327.36,"text":"tasks, from getting last month's numbers in front of the team owner to"},{"s":327.36,"e":331.4,"text":"building out the weekly meeting scorecard and recap. That is why we"},{"s":331.4,"e":335.32,"text":"need you to time each one in terms of how long it takes you now and"},{"s":335.32,"e":339.92,"text":"mark whether or not it is done, and today you'll actually mark it as"},{"s":339.92,"e":344.32,"text":"not done. This becomes your time baseline, and it's what we'll"},{"s":344.32,"e":347.64,"text":"measure each hire against, it's what I'll measure my own success"},{"s":347.64,"e":351,"text":"against, and it's what I'll measure your own performance in the course"},{"s":351,"e":353.84,"text":"against to make sure that you got out of it what you signed up for."},{"s":354.84,"e":358.84,"text":"Lastly, let's talk about how we keep all of this safe. We call that"},{"s":358.84,"e":362.28,"text":"read and draft only. That's the frame that we are using for that."},{"s":362.28,"e":365.52,"text":"So our hires, our new AI employees, can read your tools, but"},{"s":365.52,"e":369.6,"text":"anything that can send or change something in your system, like"},{"s":369.6,"e":373.6,"text":"sending an email or editing your QuickBooks gets blocked. We call"},{"s":373.6,"e":376.96,"text":"those write tools. That's not what we're producing. The only"},{"s":376.96,"e":380.64,"text":"exceptions are saving drafts and saving files to your AI office,"},{"s":380.64,"e":383.36,"text":"which I'll show you here at the end of our first session here."},{"s":384.08,"e":388.2,"text":"On Claude, we're going to block those things from writing one tool"},{"s":388.2,"e":391.76,"text":"at a time. And then on ChatGBT, we actually turn off what the"},{"s":391.76,"e":394.8,"text":"plugins let us and we add one line to your instructions that"},{"s":394.8,"e":400.16,"text":"covers the rest. This is how your instructions for the financial"},{"s":400.16,"e":404.96,"text":"analyst end. It clearly states for it, you are to read only,"},{"s":405,"e":410.08,"text":"never change the books, never send. And every seat card spells"},{"s":410.08,"e":413.08,"text":"out that same type of thing of what the hire can't do. And"},{"s":413.08,"e":415.92,"text":"those limits are what we're going to consider our guardrails."},{"s":416.56,"e":421.04,"text":"So the moral of the story is that the hire is going to draft"},{"s":421.08,"e":426.2,"text":"the actual output and then the owner is going to decide on if"},{"s":426.2,"e":430.72,"text":"this meets the standard that you all are are carrying. All"},{"s":430.72,"e":433.24,"text":"of this is going to live in what we call the AI office that"},{"s":433.24,"e":436.16,"text":"I mentioned, which is a folder in your Google Drive."},{"s":436.64,"e":439.48,"text":"Your hires are going to read from it and save to it and"},{"s":439.48,"e":442.44,"text":"any exports you pull from other tools are going to go into"},{"s":442.44,"e":446.52,"text":"its inbox folder as well. So that's how a week is going to"},{"s":446.52,"e":449.2,"text":"run and what a hire is and just some context around how"},{"s":449.2,"e":452.2,"text":"this is going to flow. If anything comes up, please don't"},{"s":452.2,"e":455.84,"text":"hesitate to reach out to me. Next, we're going to get"},{"s":455.84,"e":459.84,"text":"your time baseline started so we know how many hours this"},{"s":459.88,"e":461.64,"text":"entire experience is meant to save you."}];
